<title>CHINA: China Jan-Oct zinc exports rise 26.7 percent.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Oct zinc exports rise 26.7 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's exports of unwrought zinc and zinc alloys rose to 176,053 tonnes in the first 10 months of 1996, up 26.7 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Zinc exports were 23,354 tonnes in October.</p>
<p>China exported a total of 138,854 tonnes of zinc in the first 10 months of 1995, customs figures showed.</p>
</text>
